    <title>[V33 ENG] [CODE-FLOW REVIEW] ignition_additive_cold_path_rpm_load_table_manual_recovered</title>
    <description>CODE-FLOW REVIEWED: IGNITION ADDITIVE / INTERVENTION CORRECTION DOMAIN. Manual descriptor recovered from Ghidra bytes: FUN_000174E2 calls descriptor 0x08E1A but the earlier automatic parser missed it. It is a 2D RPM/load table to FF8486 used with the 0x08CE6 factor before scaling &gt;&gt;7. Descriptor full 0x08E1A / Galletto descriptor offset 0x0E0A. No Ronin/Wiki/KP/external XDF name is proof. V33: engineering-unit formula applied to value axis only: deg ignition correction = (X-30)*0.75. Axes remain raw/internal unless separately proven. Confirmed as additive ignition correction consumed in FUN_00017314; neutral raw 30 equals 0 deg correction, scale 0.75 deg/count.</description>
